What you'll be doing:
Developing and growing mobile applications: from the first lines of code to scaling production-ready solutions;
Collaborating closely with colleagues from different countries;
Continuously learning and keeping up with trends in the mobile development world.
What we offer:
Long-term career stability with a competitive salary paid in USD.
Conditions for steady career development.
Development supported by dedicated mentors and a variety of programs focused on expertise and innovation.
